---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="bg-base-100 mt-12 py-10 md:mt-16 md:py-16">
	<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-start gap-2 px-4">
		<div>
			<Icon
				name="gridicons/quote"
				class="text-primary-200 size-8 -translate-y-4 md:size-20"
				aria-hidden="true"
			/>
		</div>
		<div>
			<p class="h3 text-primary-600 text-justify">
				We&rsquo;ve seen Si play on the local circuit for years and have always loved his style and
				energy for music. So, when he agreed to do our wedding we were so excited!
			</p>
			<p class="h3 text-primary-600 mt-6 text-justify">
				Si came and performed to our guests and they all sang along and had a great time with him.
				He took direction from us in terms of the type of vibe we wanted to create and his set list
				matched it perfectly! Highly recommended for any type of wedding as he can switch up or down
				depending on what you want.
			</p>
			<p class="h3 text-primary-600 mt-6 text-justify">&mdash; Tom and Lou</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<Icon
				name="gridicons/quote"
				class="text-primary-200 size-8 -translate-y-4 -scale-x-100 md:size-20"
				aria-hidden="true"
			/>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
